	(text_box "Port 6 = hub port 6, busid 1-1.6; supplied by +5V_B.\nINA226 at 0x4c; expander U6 (TCA9535, 0x21).\nILIM 47k: 0.50–0.62 A; the -1 latches off after 7.5 ms in limit, FAULT_N flags it.\nINA226 Vbus on the shunt's load-side sense pad (= VBUS).\nEN pulled down: the port stays off until the node switches it on.\nPins: P1–P8 → crosspoint X lines (as the DATA ×4 v2's map, a third chip for ports 5–6);\n  an unwired VREF stays ≈ 0.4 V, under the LSF0108's 0.65 V: the firmware keeps the port's\n  crosspoint switches open while its VREF reads under 0.65 V.\nESD: VREF through U608, RESET_N / BOOT_N through U609 (flow-through).\nVREF: the board's I/O supply, 0.95–3.6 V; a 5 V board with TTL inputs: its own 3.3 V pin.\nSource only (Rp from the switched VBUS); a back-feeding source trips the TPS2553 (latched).\nThe DUT's RESET/BOOT pull-ups ≥ 4.7k: against 1k, the 1k in series stops at ≈ 1.65 V.\nHeader: black; left column VREF 1 2 3 4 BOOT, right GND 5 6 7 8 RESET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 157.48 0)
		(size 294.64 33.02)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ee2a965-8e9f-5a9e-840c-c21d4f3369f4")
	)
